sequenceDiagram
  actor G as Mysafiri
  participant W as ChatWidget
  participant F as Edge Function chat
  participant C as Claude API
  participant DB as Supabase (RPC, JWT i përdoruesit)
  G->>W: "Vilë në Prizren për 6, 20-23 korrik"
  W->>F: mesazhet + JWT
  F->>C: system prompt + tools + mesazhet
  C-->>F: tool_use search_listings
  F->>DB: kërkim pronash (RLS)
  DB-->>F: pronat
  F->>C: tool_result
  C-->>F: tool_use check_availability
  F->>DB: check_availability + quote_stay
  DB-->>F: dhomat dhe totali
  F->>C: tool_result
  C-->>F: përgjigje me opsione dhe pyetje "Konfirmon?"
  F-->>W: reply
  G->>W: "Po"
  W->>F: historiku + "Po"
  F->>C: ...
  C-->>F: tool_use create_booking
  F->>DB: rpc create_booking(source=chatbot)
  DB-->>F: booking_id
  F->>C: tool_result
  C-->>F: lidhja e pagesës
  F-->>W: reply me /checkout/ID
